  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Support healthy joint function\r\nImmune system booster & antioxidant\r\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Core series turmeric\r\nTurmeric contains 95% curcuminoids (or curcumin), the highest level on the market today. This means 95 out of every 100 milligrams of turmeric in Turmeric is curcumin.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Bioavailable curcumin: Turmeric bioavailable curcumin features liposomal delivery - a proprietary, bioenhanced form of curcumin, which is much more efficacious in the body. Research has shown liposomal technology has a greater curcuminoid bioavailability than native curcumin. Turmeric has been developed from Blackstone Labs liposmal technology combining phosphatidylcholine and beta cyclodextrin with curcumin. Turmeric exhibits an increase in stability that shields curcumin from water and improves the absorption of curcumin.\r\nLiposomal \r\nTurmeric\r\nStandardized to 95% Curcuminoids"
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "As a dietary supplement, take two (2) tablets twice daily with a meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not seen evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."
    },
